# The full golden dataset (including the ~124 MB of generated `outputs/` images) is committed so
# that a clone/pull is fully testable and reproducible: `make eval` replays the real images and the
# data-dependent tests pass.
#
# `export-ignore` omits these large folders from `git archive` and GitHub's "Download ZIP" ONLY —
# never from a clone/pull — so the downloadable source ZIP stays small (about 16 MB)
# while a clone stays complete.
data/golden/v1/outputs export-ignore
data/golden/v1/outputs/** export-ignore
data/golden/v2/outputs export-ignore
data/golden/v2/outputs/** export-ignore
data/golden/v3/outputs export-ignore
data/golden/v3/outputs/** export-ignore
